    "type": "game",
    "name": "SaGa Frontier 2 Remastered",
    "steam_appid": 2452080,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452080/extras/3028430f4fb9a8b3f91cab83a0b3b859.avif?t=1743782096\" /></span><br><strong>- Story</strong><br>Our tale starts with two protagonists: Gustave, heir to an esteemed royal line, and Wil, a young man who makes his way in the world performing excavation work.<br>Though born in the same era, their circumstances could not be more different, and as Gustave is faced with strife and conflict between nations, Wil finds himself confronting a world-threatening calamity that lurks in the shadows.<br><br>Their stories gradually coalesce to form a single history.<br><br>------------------------------<br><br>The game's &quot;History Choice&quot; system gives players the freedom to choose which events to play, and in doing so has them assume the roles of various characters and experience the world's history in fragments.<br>In addition to the glimmer and combo mechanics that the SaGa series is known for, this title also features one-on-one duels.<br>Players will find themselves confronted with battles both strategic and highly compelling.<br><br>------------------------------<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Features</h2>For this remaster, the game's impressionist watercolor graphics have been upgraded to a higher resolution, giving them a greater sense of warmth and delicacy.<br>With a completely rebuilt UI and a number of new features, the gameplay experience is smoother than ever.<br><br><strong>- New Events</strong><br>Events that touch on stories previously untold in the original have been added, as well as a number of characters who are newly playable in battle.<br>Through these additions, players will be able to experience the world of Sandail like never before.<br><br><strong>- Character Growth</strong><br>A new feature called &quot;Parameter Inheritance&quot; lets one character inherit the stats of another, allowing for greater customization.<br><br><strong>- Featuring Enhanced Bosses!</strong><br>A number of powerful, augmented bosses have been added for those seeking a greater challenge.<br><br><strong>- Dig! Dig! Digger</strong><br>Diggers you recruit in-game can be sent on expeditions.<br>Should an expedition end in success, diggers will come home with items\u2014but watch out, because they have a bad habit of slacking off when left unsupervised!<br><br><strong>- Gameplay Improvements</strong><br>With the addition of things like high-speed functionality and a New Game+ mode that allows you to carry over your completion data, changes have been made to create a more comfortable gameplay experience.<br><br>Languages: English, Japanese",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452080/extras/3028430f4fb9a8b3f91cab83a0b3b859.avif?t=1743782096\" /></span><br><strong>- Story</strong><br>Our tale starts with two protagonists: Gustave, heir to an esteemed royal line, and Wil, a young man who makes his way in the world performing excavation work.<br>Though born in the same era, their circumstances could not be more different, and as Gustave is faced with strife and conflict between nations, Wil finds himself confronting a world-threatening calamity that lurks in the shadows.<br><br>Their stories gradually coalesce to form a single history.<br><br>------------------------------<br><br>The game's &quot;History Choice&quot; system gives players the freedom to choose which events to play, and in doing so has them assume the roles of various characters and experience the world's history in fragments.<br>In addition to the glimmer and combo mechanics that the SaGa series is known for, this title also features one-on-one duels.<br>Players will find themselves confronted with battles both strategic and highly compelling.<br><br>------------------------------<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Features</h2>For this remaster, the game's impressionist watercolor graphics have been upgraded to a higher resolution, giving them a greater sense of warmth and delicacy.<br>With a completely rebuilt UI and a number of new features, the gameplay experience is smoother than ever.<br><br><strong>- New Events</strong><br>Events that touch on stories previously untold in the original have been added, as well as a number of characters who are newly playable in battle.<br>Through these additions, players will be able to experience the world of Sandail like never before.<br><br><strong>- Character Growth</strong><br>A new feature called &quot;Parameter Inheritance&quot; lets one character inherit the stats of another, allowing for greater customization.<br><br><strong>- Featuring Enhanced Bosses!</strong><br>A number of powerful, augmented bosses have been added for those seeking a greater challenge.<br><br><strong>- Dig! Dig! Digger</strong><br>Diggers you recruit in-game can be sent on expeditions.<br>Should an expedition end in success, diggers will come home with items\u2014but watch out, because they have a bad habit of slacking off when left unsupervised!<br><br><strong>- Gameplay Improvements</strong><br>With the addition of things like high-speed functionality and a New Game+ mode that allows you to carry over your completion data, changes have been made to create a more comfortable gameplay experience.<br><br>Languages: English, Japanese",
